@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Graderate System

[*] --> WaitingState : [Initial State]

state "Waiting State" as WaitingState
WaitingState : entry / rate not activated yet
WaitingState : do / check if start date is reached
WaitingState : exit / activate rate or keep waiting

WaitingState --> ActiveState : [Start Date Reached]
ActiveState : entry / rate is active now
ActiveState : do / maintain active state until end of validity period
ActiveState : exit / mark as expired when finish date is reached

state "Expired State" as ExpiredState
ExpiredState : entry / rate has expired
ExpiredState : do / remove or archive rate after one year from expiration date
ExpiredState : exit / final state

ActiveState --> ExpiredState : [Finish Date Reached]
ExpiredState --> [*] : [Final State]

@enduml
